#: admin/views/dashboard.php
msgid "Select a command, configure its options, and copy the result to your terminal. All actions run via SSH/WP-CLI, this interface is read-only."
msgstr "Selecione um comando, configure as opções e copie o resultado para o terminal. Todas as ações são executadas via SSH/WP-CLI; esta interface é somente leitura."

#: admin/views/dashboard.php
msgid "Scan files"
msgstr "Varrer arquivos"

#: admin/views/dashboard.php
msgid "Scan references"
msgstr "Varrer referências"

#: admin/views/dashboard.php
msgid "Quarantine"
msgstr "Quarentena"

#: admin/views/dashboard.php
